      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALDEBARAN EMJAY (6) is looking to improve on her last-start fourth behind Bumper Crop at Listed level over 1740m at Riverina Paceway 12 weeks ago after she broke under pressure in the run home. Won on debut as the $1.50 favourite two runs back after racing outside the leader at the bell. Rates as the one to beat. SHEEZ ONE OF US (2) made a good start to her career two weeks ago, beaten 1.5 metres into second over 1690m at Shepparton when after leading early raced  in behind the leader at the bell. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Primary contender in a similar race. KYVALLEY DIXON (7) is the next elect off a last-start win by 4.5 metres at Melton over 1720m when sent out at long odds. CLOUDY CANYON (5) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth in a tougher line-up over 1720m at Melton last time out after he raced in behind the leader at the bell. Each-way claims.",
